msgstr "Visual Studio 18 Build Tools 里 Roslyn 的 `csc.exe`"

#: manual/building.md:24
msgid "Checks"
msgstr "检查"

#: manual/building.md:30
msgid "It runs the mod's decisions headless, and the game's mod scanner on the build when the game is installed."
msgstr "脚本脱离游戏运行模组的判定逻辑；如果装了游戏，还会对构建结果运行游戏自带的模组扫描器。"

#: manual/building.md:32
msgid "Install by hand"
msgstr "手动安装"

#: manual/building.md:34
msgid "Copy the folder `out/window_workspaces` into the game's `Mods` folder, start the game, and enable the mod in the Mods menu. Mods load when the game starts, so restart after enabling or updating one."
msgstr "把 `out/window_workspaces` 文件夹复制到游戏的 `Mods` 文件夹，启动游戏，在模组菜单里启用本模组。模组在游戏启动时加载，所以启用或更新后要重启游戏。"

#: manual/building.md:36
msgid "The mod declares no capabilities, so the game enables it without a permission prompt."
msgstr "模组不声明任何权限，游戏启用它时不会弹出权限提示。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:1
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:3
#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "Snapping"
msgstr "吸附"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:5
msgid "The game moves a dragged window from its own input loop: each move sets the window to where the drag started plus how far the pointer has travelled since. The mod snaps from `Canvas.willRenderCanvases`, which Unity calls after all of the frame's game logic and right before drawing, so the snapped position is the one on screen."
msgstr "游戏在自己的输入循环里移动被拖动的窗口：每次移动，窗口的位置都是拖动起点加上指针此后走过的距离。模组在 `Canvas.willRenderCanvases` 里做吸附。Unity 在一帧的游戏逻辑全部跑完、绘制之前调用它，所以屏幕上看到的就是吸附后的位置。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:7
msgid "Because the game recomputes the position from the drag origin, snapping never accumulates: the pointer's free position is always known, and pulling away from an edge releases the window exactly under the pointer. An edge catches within 6 UI pixels and lets go beyond 10, so a snap holds without sticking."
msgstr "游戏每次都从拖动起点重新算位置，所以吸附不会累积：指针的自由位置始终已知，拖离边缘时窗口正好回到指针下面。边缘在 6 个界面像素内吸住，拖出 10 个像素才松开：吸得稳，又不会粘住窗口。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:9
msgid "Snapping does nothing while the mouse button is up. On a press, the visible windows' positions are noted; the first one that moves while the button is held is the dragged window. Edges are gathered once at that point, so each frame of a drag costs a few comparisons per window and allocates nothing."
msgstr "松开鼠标键时，吸附什么都不做。按下时，模组记下各个可见窗口的位置；按住期间第一个移动的窗口就是被拖动的窗口。边缘只在这时收集一次，所以拖动时每帧对每个窗口只做几次比较，也不分配内存。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:11
msgid "The grid is the game's own inventory cell sprite (`Window/machinery`, `cell`), tiled across the screen under an opacity filter, one tile per cell at the window's scale. Grid snapping uses the same cell. The guide lines are the game's white sprite under a colour and opacity filter. A texture pack that restyles these sprites restyles the grid and guides with them."
msgstr "网格用的是游戏自带的物品格子素材（`Window/machinery` 里的 `cell`），套上透明度滤镜平铺在整个屏幕上，按窗口的缩放比例，每个物品格子对应一块。网格吸附用的也是这个格子。参考线用的是游戏的白色素材，套上颜色和透明度滤镜。材质包改了这些素材，网格和参考线也跟着变。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:13
msgid "Finding windows"
msgstr "查找窗口"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:15
msgid "The game's own list of window roots drops a window as soon as it gets a parent item, so it never holds container windows. The mod keeps its own list from `PixelWindow.Show`, `Hide` and `Destroy`, which costs nothing between those events, and checks `IsVisible` when it reads it. Performance Fixes answers `IsVisible` for windows it hid by switching off their canvas, so a hidden window is never a snap target or part of a workspace."
msgstr "游戏自己的窗口根列表里没有容器窗口，因为窗口一有所属物品，就会被它移除。模组根据 `PixelWindow.Show`、`Hide` 和 `Destroy` 维护自己的列表，两次事件之间没有开销，读取时再检查 `IsVisible`。性能修复隐藏窗口时会关掉它的画布，并代为回答 `IsVisible`，所以隐藏的窗口不会成为吸附目标，也不会算进工作区。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:17
#: manual/workspaces.md:18
msgid "Switching"
msgstr "切换"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:19
msgid "Windows open through the game's `ItemMouseDoubleClickHandler.OpenContentAction`, which shows a container's window and then places it from `PlayerStore.contentWindowPositions`. The mod writes the workspace's positions there first and lets the game do the rest, then restores the tab selection with `ApplyContentTabsSelection`. Windows close with `GameItem.CloseContentWindow`. Anything else that hooks those calls, such as Performance Fixes' per-window canvases and fast hiding, applies as usual."
msgstr "窗口通过游戏的 `ItemMouseDoubleClickHandler.OpenContentAction` 打开：它先显示容器的窗口，再按 `PlayerStore.contentWindowPositions` 摆放。模组先把工作区记下的位置写进去，其余交给游戏，然后用 `ApplyContentTabsSelection` 恢复标签页。窗口用 `GameItem.CloseContentWindow` 关闭。其他挂在这些调用上的功能照常生效，例如性能修复的独立画布和快速隐藏。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:21
msgid "Opening a full storage window is real work for Unity, so a switch is queued and run over several frames: each frame runs queued steps until 3 ms are spent, always at least one, closing first."
msgstr "打开一个装满东西的存储窗口，对 Unity 来说开销不小，所以一次切换会排成队，分几帧执行：每帧执行排队的步骤，直到用满 3 毫秒（至少执行一步），先关后开。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:23
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "保存"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:25
msgid "Workspaces are stored per save slot (`PlayerStore.saveSlotId`) in `PlayerPrefs`, by item id, which is stable within a save. The mod reads the store from its static field rather than `PlayerStore.Instance`, which would create a store at the main menu."
msgstr "工作区按存档槽位（`PlayerStore.saveSlotId`）保存在 `PlayerPrefs` 里，用物品 ID 记录，物品 ID 在同一个存档内不变。模组直接读店铺对象的静态字段，不调用 `PlayerStore.Instance`，因为后者在主菜单会新建一个店铺对象。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:27
msgid "The manager and the notice"
msgstr "管理窗口和切换提示"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:29
msgid "The manager is a window of the game's `CustomUIManager`, laid out like the storage-preset manager, with the game's own item chips. The switch notice is a machine `PixelWindow` with the game's radio buttons. Both are drawn entirely with the game's assets."
msgstr "管理窗口是游戏 `CustomUIManager` 的窗口，布局照存储预设管理窗口，用游戏自带的物品卡片。切换提示是一个机器 `PixelWindow`，里面是游戏的单选按钮。两者都完全用游戏自带的素材绘制。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:31
msgid "Leaving the store"
msgstr "离开商店"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:33
msgid "A store's items, inventories and windows all point at each other, so a single one kept by a mod keeps the whole store in memory after the player leaves it. The windows destroyed with the store's scene never go through `PixelWindow.Destroy`, so the mod lets go of them itself: when a scene other than the store (`InventoryScene`) replaces it, it takes the destroyed windows out of its list of open windows, drops the switch notice's window (built again on the next switch), closes the manager, empties any queued switch steps and forgets the windows noted for snapping. Player.log gets one line with how many windows were released. Nothing changes inside the store."
msgstr "商店里的物品、库存和窗口互相引用，所以模组只要留着其中一个，玩家离开商店后整个商店就会留在内存里。随商店场景一起销毁的窗口不会经过 `PixelWindow.Destroy`，所以模组要自己放手：商店（`InventoryScene`）被别的场景取代时，模组把已销毁的窗口从已打开窗口列表里去掉，丢掉切换提示的窗口（下次切换时重建），关闭管理窗口，清空排队的切换步骤，并忘掉为吸附记下的窗口。Player.log 里会写一行，说明放开了多少个窗口。商店内部什么都不变。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:35
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "测试"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:37
msgid "The mod's decisions are kept apart from Unity and the game in `src/*.Pure.cs`, which use nothing but plain C#: which edge a dragged window snaps to, how far it moves to the grid, which workspace comes next, and when the store has been left. The code that talks to the game only measures windows and passes them on."
msgstr "模组的判定逻辑和 Unity、游戏分开，放在 `src/*.Pure.cs` 里，只用纯 C#：拖动的窗口吸附到哪条边、对齐网格要移多远、下一个工作区是哪个、什么时候算离开了商店。和游戏打交道的代码只量窗口，再把结果交给这些判定。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:39
msgid "`tests/run.sh` runs the checks:"
msgstr "`tests/run.sh` 运行这些检查："

#: manual/how-it-works.md:41
msgid "`tests/PureTest.cs` runs those decisions headless, without the game or Unity: catching an edge within 6 pixels, holding it up to 10, matching edges, screen edges, windows that are too far away, grid rounding and wrapping around the workspaces."
msgstr "`tests/PureTest.cs` 不需要游戏和 Unity，直接检验这些判定：6 像素内吸住边缘，10 像素内保持吸附，对齐同侧边缘，屏幕边缘，离得太远的窗口，网格取整，以及工作区首尾相接地循环切换。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:42
msgid "`tests/StoreExitTest.cs` checks when the store counts as left: only for the first scene that replaces it, never for additive scenes or the main menu at start."
msgstr "`tests/StoreExitTest.cs` 检验什么时候算离开商店：只有第一个取代商店的场景算，叠加加载的场景和启动时的主菜单都不算。"

#: manual/how-it-works.md:43
msgid "`tests/ScanTest.cs` runs the game's own mod scanner on the built DLL, when the game is installed. The result is no capabilities."
msgstr "装了游戏时，`tests/ScanTest.cs` 用游戏自带的模组扫描器扫描构建出的 DLL，结果是不需要任何权限。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "Window Workspaces"
msgstr "窗口工作区"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "![Window Workspaces cover](../attachments/cover.png)"
msgstr "![窗口工作区封面](../attachments/cover.png)"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "Window Workspaces adds two things for container windows. Windows snap into place while you drag them. Workspaces keep several sets of open containers, and one key switches between them, like virtual desktops."
msgstr "窗口工作区为容器窗口加了两样东西。拖动窗口时，窗口会自动吸附到位。工作区保存几组打开的容器，像虚拟桌面一样，一个键就能在它们之间切换。"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "Drag a window by its title bar as usual. When one of its edges comes close to the edge of another window or of the screen, it snaps there, and a guide line marks the edge it holds. Pull a little further and it lets go."
msgstr "照常拖动窗口的标题栏。窗口的某条边靠近其他窗口或屏幕边缘时，会吸附到那里，一条参考线标出吸住的边。再往外拖一点，窗口就松开。"

#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "Away from any edge, the window lines up with a faint grid the size of one inventory cell, so windows sit on the same grid as the items in them. The grid only shows while you drag."
msgstr "不靠近任何边缘时，窗口会对齐一层浅浅的网格，一格就是一个物品格子，所以窗口和里面的物品在同一套网格上。网格只在拖动时显示。"

#: manual/index.md:13
msgid "Hold **Alt** while dragging to move a window freely."
msgstr "拖动时按住 **Alt**，可以自由移动窗口。"

#: manual/index.md:15
#: manual/workspaces.md:1
msgid "Workspaces"
msgstr "工作区"

#: manual/index.md:17
msgid "A workspace is a set of open containers, each with its position and selected tab. You start in one workspace, and everything you open belongs to it."
msgstr "工作区是一组打开的容器，每个容器都记着窗口位置和选中的标签页。你一开始在一个工作区里，打开的所有容器都属于它。"

#: manual/index.md:19
msgid "When you switch to another workspace, the windows of the one you leave are remembered and closed, and the windows of the one you enter open where you left them. A new workspace starts empty. Switch to it and open the containers it should hold."
msgstr "切换到另一个工作区时，原来那个工作区的窗口会被记住并关闭，新工作区的窗口会在你上次离开时的位置打开。新建的工作区是空的：切换过去，再打开想放进去的容器就行。"

#: manual/index.md:21
msgid "See [Workspaces](workspaces.md) for the manager and the keys."
msgstr "管理窗口和按键见[工作区](workspaces.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:23
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: manual/index.md:25
msgid "Bind the two keys in the game's options menu, in the key bindings:"
msgstr "在游戏选项的按键绑定里绑定这两个键："

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Key"
msgstr "按键"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: manual/index.md:29
msgid "Next workspace"
msgstr "下一个工作区"

#: manual/index.md:29
msgid "Switches to the next workspace. Hold Shift for the previous one."
msgstr "切换到下一个工作区。按住 Shift 切换到上一个。"

#: manual/index.md:30
msgid "Workspace manager"
msgstr "工作区管理"

#: manual/index.md:30
msgid "Opens the window to switch, create, rename and delete workspaces."
msgstr "打开管理窗口，用来切换、新建、重命名和删除工作区。"

#: manual/index.md:32
msgid "Neither key has a default. The mod's options (the gear in the Mods menu) turn **Snap windows**, **Snap to the grid** and **Show the grid while dragging** on or off. All three are on by default."
msgstr "两个键都没有默认按键。模组选项（在模组菜单里点齿轮图标）有三个开关：**窗口吸附**、**吸附到网格**和**拖动时显示网格**，默认都开着。"

#: manual/index.md:34
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "兼容性"

#: manual/index.md:36
msgid "The mod hooks only `PixelWindow.Show`, `Hide` and `Destroy`, to keep a list of open windows, and changes no game behaviour. It works on its own and together with Performance Fixes, which makes switching back to a workspace nearly instant. It needs no special permissions."
msgstr "模组只挂接 `PixelWindow.Show`、`Hide` 和 `Destroy`，用来维护已打开窗口的列表，不改变游戏的任何行为。它可以单独使用，也可以和性能修复一起用，后者能让切回工作区几乎瞬间完成。不需要任何特殊权限。"

#: manual/workspaces.md:3
msgid "The manager"
msgstr "管理窗口"

#: manual/workspaces.md:5
msgid "Press the key bound to **Workspace manager** to open the manager. It is built like the game's own storage-preset manager."
msgstr "按下绑定给**工作区管理**的键，打开管理窗口。它照游戏自带的存储预设管理窗口搭建。"

#: manual/workspaces.md:7
msgid "Each workspace has a row with:"
msgstr "每个工作区占一行："

#: manual/workspaces.md:9
msgid "its name, which you can type over (an unnamed workspace shows as \"Workspace 2\" and so on);"
msgstr "名字，可以直接改（没有名字的工作区显示为“工作区 2”这样的编号）；"

#: manual/workspaces.md:10
msgid "**Switch**, or **Current** for the workspace you are in;"
msgstr "**切换**按钮；你所在的工作区显示**当前**；"

#: manual/workspaces.md:11
msgid "the number of windows it holds;"
msgstr "它包含的窗口数；"

#: manual/workspaces.md:12
msgid "a cross to delete it."
msgstr "删除它的叉号。"

#: manual/workspaces.md:14
msgid "Below the row, its containers are shown as item chips. Click a chip to take that container out of the workspace; in the workspace you are in, its window closes too."
msgstr "这一行下面用物品卡片显示它的容器。点击卡片，把那个容器移出工作区；如果是你所在的工作区，它的窗口也会关闭。"

#: manual/workspaces.md:16
msgid "**New workspace** adds an empty workspace at the end, up to nine. Deleting the workspace you are in first moves you to its neighbour, so its windows close with it. The last workspace cannot be deleted."
msgstr "**新建工作区**在末尾添加一个空工作区，最多九个。删除你所在的工作区时，会先切换到相邻的工作区，所以它的窗口也一起关闭。最后一个工作区不能删除。"

#: manual/workspaces.md:20
msgid "Press **Next workspace** to move to the next workspace, and Shift with it to go back. A small window near the top of the screen shows which workspace you are in, with one button per workspace; click one to switch to it."
msgstr "按**下一个工作区**键切换到下一个工作区，按住 Shift 再按则回到上一个。屏幕上方会出现一个小窗口，标出你在哪个工作区，每个工作区一个按钮，点一下就切过去。"

#: manual/workspaces.md:22
msgid "A switch closes the windows the new workspace does not have and opens the ones it has. Windows open one after another within a few milliseconds per frame, so the game keeps moving while a large set opens."
msgstr "切换时，新工作区没有的窗口会关掉，它有的窗口会打开。窗口一个接一个打开，每帧只占几毫秒，所以一大组窗口打开时，游戏也不会卡住。"

#: manual/workspaces.md:24
msgid "What is remembered"
msgstr "会记住什么"

#: manual/workspaces.md:26
msgid "For every container: which item it is, where its window was and which tab it showed. Workspaces are kept per save slot, so each save has its own."
msgstr "每个容器记下：是哪个物品、窗口在什么位置、显示哪个标签页。工作区按存档槽位分别保存，每个存档有自己的一套。"

#: manual/workspaces.md:28
msgid "A container that is sold or thrown away stays in the list as \"(gone)\" and is skipped when you switch; click its chip to forget it."
msgstr "被卖掉或扔掉的容器会以“（已不在）”留在列表里，切换时跳过；点它的卡片可以把它忘掉。"
